  m_Name: MallowQuest
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  initialDialog:
  - "You\u2019ve got soft steps for someone with business in these woods."
  - "\r(He stifles a cough and chuckles faintly.\r\n"
  - "Tell me\u2026 you wouldn\u2019t be carrying any Glitterroom, would you?"
  - "Magic\u2019s been drifting odd lately. Folks avoid this grove, and the silence
    sits heavy."
  - "And I\u2014\r\nwell, these lungs of mine feel like they\u2019ve braided themselves
    with moss.\r\n"
  - "If you\u2019ve got even a pinch of the stuff\u2026 it might keep me upright
    a little longer."
  acceptOption: I can look for Glitterroom.
  acceptAnswer: "Ah\u2026 thank you. Glitterroom isn\u2019t fond of company \u2014
    it hides where the light forgets to look."
  declineOption: "I can\u2019t help you right now..."
  declineAnswer: "No harm in asking. I\u2019ll manage\u2026 or wheeze my way into
    the next sunrise.\r"
  comebackAfterDecline: "Back again? My offer still stands. Glitterroom\u2019s out
    there, and my lungs are running out of negotiations."
  comebackInProgress: "You\u2019re empty-handed. That\u2019s all right. Glitterroom
    likes to hide."
  comebackCompleted: "Is that\u2026? Yes. Glitterroom \u2014 fresh and stubborn.\r\nYou\u2019ve
    done me a kindness I can\u2019t repay with coin or breath alone.\r"
  finalWords: "Thank you...\r\nTake this Stripped Scarf \u2014 it\u2019s traveled
    farther than I have strength left for.\r\nMay it keep the cold from biting too
    deep.\r\n"
